+# Lansing Codes Sign-in Sheet Contributing Guide
+
+Thanks for helping improve the event sign-in sheet. Please read the
+[Code of Conduct](https://www.lansing.codes/code-of-conduct/) before contributing.
+
+- [Issue Reporting Guidelines](#issue-reporting-guidelines)
+- [Pull Request Guidelines](#pull-request-guidelines)
+- [Development Setup](#development-setup)
+- [Local Testing](#local-testing)
+- [Deployments](#deployments)
+
+## Issue Reporting Guidelines
+
+Search [existing issues](https://github.com/lansingcodes/sign-in-sheet/issues)
+before opening a new one. For a bug, include the steps to reproduce it, what
+you expected, what happened, your browser and operating system, and a screenshot
+if it helps. For a feature request, explain the problem it would solve and the
+proposed behavior. Do not include private attendee information in an issue.
+
+## Pull Request Guidelines
+
+Create a focused branch from `main` and open a pull request back to `main`.
+Link the related issue, describe the change, and include the local checks you
+ran. If your change affects printing, attach a print-preview screenshot or
+describe the page count and layout you observed. Request a review from a
+maintainer before merging. Keep attendee details and credentials out of commits.
+
+## Development Setup
+
+You need [Git](https://git-scm.com/downloads), a text editor, a modern browser,
+and [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) to run the local preview command below. A
+code editor with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript support is useful; no build step or
+service credentials are required for this static site.
+
+Fork the repository on GitHub, then clone your fork and enter the checkout:
+
+```sh
+git clone https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/sign-in-sheet.git
+cd sign-in-sheet
+```
+
+## Local Testing
+
+From the repository root, start a local server with `live-server`:
+
+```sh
+npx --yes live-server --port=8080 --no-browser
+```
+
+Open <http://127.0.0.1:8080/>; if that port is busy, open the URL that
+`live-server` prints instead. Enter an event title and try the page-count and
+line-number controls. Check the browser's print preview: the sign-in area should
+fit the chosen page count, and red editing instructions should not print. Also
+try a long title and a narrow browser window. Stop the server with Ctrl+C.
+
+## Deployments
+
+GitHub Pages serves this repository from the root of `main` at
+<https://lansingcodes.github.io/sign-in-sheet/>. After a reviewed pull request
+is merged into `main`, GitHub Pages builds the updated site. A maintainer
+should verify the deployment and the public page; contributors should not push
+directly to `main`.
